7. Accordingly, the following order:
ORDER (i) All the appeals are allowed in-part;
(ii) The claimants in all these cases are entitled for a sum of Rs.80,000/- each along with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition till realization, in addition to the award made by the Tribunal;
(iii) The respondent No.2-Insurance company is directed to deposit the compensation along with interest within a period of six weeks from the date of this order.

